   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-weekly-update-1\" name=\"tec-weekly-update-1\"></a>TEC Weekly Update</h1>\n<hr/>\n<h2>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#saturday-july-3-2021-2\" name=\"saturday-july-3-2021-2\"></a><strong>Saturday, July 3, 2021</strong>\n</h2>\n<p>Hi! Here are the Working Group updates from the last week. Join us in real time during any of our many calls! <a href=\"https://https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/embed?src=5mkep1ad1j860k6g7i7fr8plq0@group.calendar.google.com&amp;ctz=Europe/Berlin\">Check out the calendar</a>.</p>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#big-news-tec-will-be-in-paris-for-ethcc-4httpsethccio-july-20-22-3\" name=\"big-news-tec-will-be-in-paris-for-ethcc-4httpsethccio-july-20-22-3\"></a>BIG NEWS:  TEC will be in Paris for <a href=\"https://ethcc.io/\">EthCC 4</a> July 20-22!</h3>\n<p>Let us know if you’ll be there too, and come say “hi” on our Discord <span class=\"hashtag\">#community-hall</span> channel.</p>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#comms-4\" name=\"comms-4\"></a><img alt=\":satellite:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/satellite.png?v=9\" title=\":satellite:\"/> Comms</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>We are finishing up the Hatcher campaign content.</li>\n<li>Stay tuned for our community video next week.</li>\n<li>TE Scouts are moving ahead!</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Forum Highlight</strong>: <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/how-to-get-wxdai-a-bridging-story/347\">How to get wxDAI</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#commons-swarm-5\" name=\"commons-swarm-5\"></a><img alt=\":globe_with_meridians:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/globe_with_meridians.png?v=9\" title=\":globe_with_meridians:\"/> Commons Swarm</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>A <a href=\"https://hatch.tecommons.org\">47-hour test</a> is happening over the weekend. All feedback via the feedback form is very welcome!</li>\n<li>Request for comments on <a href=\"https://hackmd.io/7h0GvC1sRsWWlzgetDSbyQ?view\">RFC: EVMScripter API Specification</a>.</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://rinkeby.convert.tecommons.org/\">Convert</a> working with:\n<ul>\n<li>New contract</li>\n<li>Entry and exit tributes</li>\n<li>Virtual Supply and Virtual Balance</li>\n<li>Minimum return amount</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Forum Highlight</strong>: <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/pseudo-code-and-permission-tables-for-the-commons-upgrade/431/2\">Pseudo-code and permission tables for the Commons Upgrade </a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#gravity-6\" name=\"gravity-6\"></a><img alt=\":dove:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/dove.png?v=9\" title=\":dove:\"/> Gravity</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Opened a space for a discussion on Equality vs. Equity in the this week’s sync. You can watch it <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=axsQHUu0esE\">here</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#hatch-outreach-7\" name=\"hatch-outreach-7\"></a>🏄‍♂️ Hatch Outreach</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>The results of the IH Outreach campaign:\n<ul>\n<li>75% with &gt;10 IH are in the Trusted Seed</li>\n<li>63% with &gt;4 IH are in the Trusted Seed</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Finishing touches on the Hatch Handbook</li>\n<li>This Hatch Outreach Working Group will end at the end of the Hatch period. The weekly call after the  Hatch close will  be a no-agenda, social call. Join us to celebrate the close of the Hatch!</li>\n<li>Eduardo prepared a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QrVWGmBMEthR59G8xnH4Pkmem_ib7y4qHEGpmud3rWc/edit#heading=h.yxpwzx470gkv\">closing document</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#labs-8\" name=\"labs-8\"></a><img alt=\":microscope:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/microscope.png?v=9\" title=\":microscope:\"/> Labs</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuing work on TE services, Praise analysis, TEC labs and the legendary Sunday hack sessions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#legal-9\" name=\"legal-9\"></a><img alt=\":classical_building:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/classical_building.png?v=9\" title=\":classical_building:\"/> Legal</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Working on the Community Covenant, the rules to which we must agree in order to engage in the community.</li>\n<li>Review of legal docs before the Hatch.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#0mega-10\" name=\"0mega-10\"></a><img alt=\":dizzy:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/dizzy.png?v=9\" title=\":dizzy:\"/> 0mega</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuing initiatives:\n<ul>\n<li>TE Consilience - working on “<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1GwTiq1RcRfnDrr-Po8BbWVpOxl0b9gD1emjmgqIJDy4/edit#\">Common Knowledge Hub</a>”</li>\n<li>Ethos of Token Engineering - working on “<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_y2SLg44oxCm6PDS8MxXHu6mh80-M6pPREEKVIu4BIE/edit#\">Research Method</a>”</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#params-11\" name=\"params-11\"></a><img alt=\":robot:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/robot.png?v=9\" title=\":robot:\"/> Params</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuing Commons Configuration Dashboard.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#soft-gov-12\" name=\"soft-gov-12\"></a><img alt=\":raised_hands:t4:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/raised_hands/4.png?v=9\" title=\":raised_hands:t4:\"/> Soft Gov</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Last week we had our first <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_ehMtCzzgRZyKm-gTOOYaaT3vbNtWAu0O5CvI3ql3UE/edit#gid=720868603\">SourceCred  distribution!</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>We are mid-way through voting on the <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/pre-hatch-impact-hours-distribution-analysis/376/49\">pre-Hatch Impact Hours Distribution Analysis</a>. Submitting and voting on proposals ran from June 24 to July 2 with a 24h extension until July 3 at the request of the community. Four proposals were selected from seven for the run-off and finalized Friday, July 2. Voting is open until July 6. <a href=\"https://tokenlog.xyz/CommonsBuild/IH-intervention\">Vote here!</a></p>\n<p><strong>Here are the 4 run-off proposals:</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>10.</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/IH-intervention/issues/10\">Bad for the Commons is bad for us all, restore 40% of deleted earned Impact Hours</a></p>\n<p><strong>11.</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/IH-intervention/issues/11\"><img alt=\":fire:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/fire.png?v=9\" title=\":fire:\"/> PRAISEMAGEDDON <img alt=\":fire:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/fire.png?v=9\" title=\":fire:\"/></a></p>\n<p><strong>12.</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/IH-intervention/issues/12\"><img alt=\":alien:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/alien.png?v=9\" title=\":alien:\"/> No Abnormal Intervention <img alt=\":alien:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/alien.png?v=9\" title=\":alien:\"/><img alt=\":no_entry_sign:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/no_entry_sign.png?v=9\" title=\":no_entry_sign:\"/> 75% Governance Rights returned to paid contributors via vote Post-Hatch &amp; Praise Party for TE Rockstars</a></p>\n<p><strong>13.</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/CommonsBuild/IH-intervention/issues/13\">When the best intervention is not to intervene</a></p>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#stewards-13\" name=\"stewards-13\"></a><img alt=\":ear_of_rice:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/ear_of_rice.png?v=9\" title=\":ear_of_rice:\"/> Stewards</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>We are nearly there!  Pending final results from Soft Gov and Commons Swarm, the Hatch could be as early as next week!<br/>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/53fc758f6cd71cb8f152f486ea98c5c19408f140\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/53fc758f6cd71cb8f152f486ea98c5c19408f140.png\" title=\"\"><img alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"bYYwknBN3hs9ZG4MUr9g7kcNBC0\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/53fc758f6cd71cb8f152f486ea98c5c19408f140_2_10x10.png\" height=\"466\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/53fc758f6cd71cb8f152f486ea98c5c19408f140_2_690x466.png\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/53fc758f6cd71cb8f152f486ea98c5c19408f140_2_690x466.png, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/53fc758f6cd71cb8f152f486ea98c5c19408f140.png 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/53fc758f6cd71cb8f152f486ea98c5c19408f140.png 2x\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">947×640 103 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Forum highlight</strong>: <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/tec-visual-explainers/461\">TEC Visual explainers</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#transparency-14\" name=\"transparency-14\"></a><img alt=\":male_detective:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/male_detective.png?v=9\" title=\":male_detective:\"/> Transparency</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Continuing <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/credential-management/417\">Credential management discussion</a>\n</li>\n<li>Working on <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hnwSQn4vxboxazraX2qPwa25bBBrvk3TpXsSDkXhqCM/edit\">Code of Conduct for platforms</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#thanks-for-reading-see-you-soon-15\" name=\"thanks-for-reading-see-you-soon-15\"></a>Thanks for reading! See you soon! <img alt=\":wave:t5:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/wave/5.png?v=9\" title=\":wave:t5:\"/>\n</h2>",
